{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{slogan}\nMonomorphisms of stacks are injective on points.\n\\end{slogan}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism-injective-points}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:02cdbb8ea1f655f0ebef50fc86de3cb3623a16e5b60297c9eb62e9f662039ccc", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nA monomorphism of algebraic stacks induces an injective map of\nsets of points.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7ab57944bdbfde377c27cf522fb3ac95ebb7f7b0a124a3351aac78db5e19e62f", "unit_id": "tag:0500:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$x_i : \\Spec(K_i) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$f \\circ x_1$", "MATH_0004": "$f \\circ x_2$", "MATH_0005": "$|\\mathcal{Y}|$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Omega$", "MATH_0007": "$c_i : \\Spec(\\Omega) \\to \\Spec(K_i)$", "MATH_0008": "$2$", "MATH_0009": "$\\beta : f \\circ x_1 \\circ c_1 \\to f \\circ x_1 \\circ c_2$", "MATH_0010": "$f$", "MATH_0011": "$\\beta$", "MATH_0012": "$\\alpha : x_1 \\circ c_1 \\to x_1 \\circ c_2$", "MATH_0013": "$x_1$", "MATH_0014": "$x_2$", "MATH_0015": "$|\\mathcal{X}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-monomorphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ad1112882ab134dc1807bbf11788d97fe458940c812e6f284ac9389117d9759e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f60abf18839cac482c76eb1f94c99ef1a4b1fc2d6afb26df55583d615fd34787", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a monomorphism of algebraic stacks.\nSuppose that <MATH_0002> be morphisms such that\n<MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> define the same element of <MATH_0005>.\nApplying the definition we find a common extension <MATH_0006> with corresponding\nmorphisms <MATH_0007> and a\n<MATH_0008>-isomorphism <MATH_0009>.\nAs <MATH_0010> is fully faithful, see\nLemma <REF_0001>,\nwe can lift <MATH_0011> to an isomorphism\n<MATH_0012>.\nHence <MATH_0013> and <MATH_0014> define the same point of <MATH_0015>\nas desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0a681ca4f5d4f76b9ac22e76681bb7c0578b9f85bee108a85cd0f561c4874087", "unit_id": "tag:0500:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}' \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}'$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r] \\ar[d] &\n\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{X}' \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{X}' \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}'\n}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-monomorphism-diagonal}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8fec68acc03c281a9d54b66263b9a79654a66a084c716ff2ae6990cd23d276c5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:46368eb6f3eb02810432112d7580ebb7073ff68e57c0cd48fcc5d68f0d7339a6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be morphisms\nof algebraic stacks. If <MATH_0002> is a monomorphism\nthen the canonical diagram\n<MATH_0003>\nis a fibre product square.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c6bd1ce1702ab05d6146505d3742914a6c238589fc6c11c96ee5a62187d59ad5", "unit_id": "tag:0CBB:statement"}
